        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the charm of cats in the cat café</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the cute cats’ mischievous tricks (anomalies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat-eared maid will give you hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We tried to create the purr-fect cat game for streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Streamer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream from this unique cat cafe setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overflowing with cuteness — it's almost impossible to keep streaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Vocabulary meltdown incoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create heartwarming interactions between the streamer and the cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your audience laugh as the cats drive you wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selfish cats, flustered streamers, happy viewers! Everyone wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Streaming and Video Posting Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream or upload videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertising and monetization of your streams/videos are completely acceptable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and corporations are welcome to stream and post gameplay content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permission from the author is required for any game streaming or video posting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on streaming or showing the game's ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the game title and sales link in your video is not required, but it would be a big help for promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: The developer takes no responsibility for any trouble or damages caused by streaming or posting videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy for Anyone to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lightweight 3D game that runs on a standard laptop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It works even on computers without a graphics card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are standard FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepads are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty can be set to Easy, Normal, or Hard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so even beginners or those who aren’t confident with games can enjoy playing without stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t find the exit of the café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're stuck in the cat cafe, and a cat-eared maid approaches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ah… are you trying to get out of here too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you leave through the exit, you end up back at the entrance, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll share the ‘rules for escaping’ that the cats taught me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‘If something feels meow-strange, turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it doesn’t feel meow-strange, keep going forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fix an anomaly, go forward too.’</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind cat taught me those rules, but honestly… they’re too tricky for me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So I want you to find the exit… meow.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is an anomyeowly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes strange things happen in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example... the cat is wearing a strange hat, or the cat suddenly breaks a plate...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 10 cats you just saw increase to 11...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of anomalies await you, from hilarious cat pranks to shocking horror traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter such an unusual &quot;anomaly,&quot; turn back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if there is <strong>no</strong> &quot;anomaly,&quot; just keep going forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fix an anomary, you can move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems the Anomaly Mode won't be deactivated unless the <strong>10 cats are satisfied</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that the cats' anger is causing the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's up to you to uncover the anomalies in this looping cat café, with the cat-eared maid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the charm of cats in the cat café</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the cute cats’ mischievous tricks (anomalies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat-eared maid will give you hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We tried to create the purr-fect cat game for streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Streamer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream from this unique cat cafe setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overflowing with cuteness — it's almost impossible to keep streaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Vocabulary meltdown incoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create heartwarming interactions between the streamer and the cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your audience laugh as the cats drive you wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selfish cats, flustered streamers, happy viewers! Everyone wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Streaming and Video Posting Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream or upload videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertising and monetization of your streams/videos are completely acceptable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and corporations are welcome to stream and post gameplay content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permission from the author is required for any game streaming or video posting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on streaming or showing the game's ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the game title and sales link in your video is not required, but it would be a big help for promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: The developer takes no responsibility for any trouble or damages caused by streaming or posting videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy for Anyone to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lightweight 3D game that runs on a standard laptop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It works even on computers without a graphics card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are standard FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepads are also supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty can be set to Easy, Normal, or Hard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so even beginners or those who aren’t confident with games can enjoy playing without stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t find the exit of the café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're stuck in the cat cafe, and a cat-eared maid approaches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ah… are you trying to get out of here too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you leave through the exit, you end up back at the entrance, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll share the ‘rules for escaping’ that the cats taught me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‘If something feels meow-strange, turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it doesn’t feel meow-strange, keep going forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fix an anomaly, go forward too.’</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind cat taught me those rules, but honestly… they’re too tricky for me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So I want you to find the exit… meow.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is an anomyeowly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes strange things happen in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example... the cat is wearing a strange hat, or the cat suddenly breaks a plate...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 10 cats you just saw increase to 11...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of anomalies await you, from hilarious cat pranks to shocking horror traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter such an unusual &quot;anomaly,&quot; turn back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if there is <strong>no</strong> &quot;anomaly,&quot; just keep going forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fix an anomary, you can move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems the Anomaly Mode won't be deactivated unless the <strong>10 cats are satisfied</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that the cats' anger is causing the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's up to you to uncover the anomalies in this looping cat café, with the cat-eared maid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The cat café is supposed to be a blissful feline paradise... but something feels off. Mischievous cats cause all kinds of anomalies, throwing the shop into chaos. Even the pretty cat-eared maid is completely at a loss, meowing for help.",
